  "weapon": "grip centre (right fist) at the origin, tip toward Blender +Z (glTF +Y), main cutting edge toward +X, flat in the XZ plane. Attach the glTF scene to the bone `weapon_R` with an identity local transform.",
  "twoHanded": "right hand at the origin, left hand at z = offhandGrip (handle is long enough for 0.17 .. 0.30 m below).",
  "blade": "[z_base, z_tip] of the damaging part along the weapon axis (glTF +Y), for weapon trails / hit sweeps.",
  "shield": "upright, facing Blender -Y (glTF +Z), straps side at the origin: attach to the bone `shield_L` with an identity local transform. The forearm lies along X behind the board (elbow toward +X); the fist closes on the rolled grip at gripLocal. Bent shields have their centre slightly in FRONT of the origin plane so that the straight forearm bridges the hollow.",
  "materials": "engine materials by NAME; vertex color COLOR_0 (linear) carries the albedo tint + wear on every primitive."
